 "Do not delay in a scanner if he is unstable and the diagnosis is clinical. Hb 98.",
 "What is the most appropriate next step?",
 "Immediate vascular/endovascular control (theatre or hybrid), permissive hypotension, large-bore access — not a prolonged CT in shock",
